      "writtenOn": "2018-12-12T01:31:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, for now, only one of them(CONFIG_HOSTCMD_LPC and HAS_TASK_IPC_MNG) should be enabled.\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/1263897\nand https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/1263896 are merged.\nSo existing CONFIG_HOSTCMD_LPC(which no one used) is disabled.",
      "parentUuid": "639eddb9_63c96b4f",
