      "message": "I don\u0027t see why it matters for speef if you do the DRBL-\u003e size calculation in the parent function of this function. All of the callers of this function are doing the same calculation, so why not do the calculation in this function and omit this parameter from being passed (so we would have 3 parameter for this function signature)",
